OL,3,AJordan carries out deadly strike in
OL,4,ASyria in retaliation for church attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FJordan has struck what its military
OL,7,Fsays were "terrorist organisations" in
OL,8,FSyria in retaliation for an attack on a
OL,9,FChristian funeral last week that killed
OL,10,Fnine people.
OL,12,FSyrian health officials told state
OL,13,Fmedia that five people, including
OL,14,Fwomen, children and an elderly man,
OL,15,Fwere killed in the strike on a village
OL,16,Fin the southern Daraa province. Jordan
OL,17,Fsaid its fighter jets had killed and
OL,18,Fwounded "several terrorists", without
OL,19,Fgiving further details.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
