OL,3,AJordan carries out deadly strike in
OL,4,ASyria in retaliation for church attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FJordan said it had co-ordinated with
OL,7,Fthe Syrian government, but Syria said
OL,8,Fit had not been notified of Monday's
OL,9,Fattack.
OL,11,FIt comes after nine people were killed
OL,12,Fand 34 injured in a shooting at a
OL,13,Ffuneral in a Greek Orthodox church in
OL,14,FKarak on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
